{"parentUuid":"b27564aa-f034-4151-9640-98e594a2bd97","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a97ae4416eb4bd8cf","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01A7JHfukowyjCrfTuMQSEPW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FUBYv1fqPJq34hLE8jvZdj","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://cpmpy.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api/solvers/pumpkin.html","prompt":"Extract: CPMpy Pumpkin interface - which constraints are supported via Pumpkin backend, how to call it, limitations, examples"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3540,"cache_read_input_tokens":27040,"output_tokens":467,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3540},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":467,"cache_read_input_tokens":27040,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3540,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3540,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaotfPSZrSXEgPxCNTspr","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"10e00336-dad0-49e2-9adc-6685929b7ec6","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:07:59.041Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"2c5b21c6-fa86-4277-ade8-c3921036ce09","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"a97ae4416eb4bd8cf","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01V3xvwMEm9N2y9mp3FGv2Jf","type":"tool_result","content":"# MiniZinc Challenge 2025 Medal Winners\n\n## Medal Results by Category\n\n**Fixed Search:**\n- Gold: OR-Tools CP-SAT\n- Silver: Choco-solver CP-SAT\n- Bronze: SICStus Prolog / Pumpkin\n\n**Free Search:**\n- Gold: OR-Tools CP-SAT\n- Silver: PicatSAT\n- Bronze: Choco-solver CP-SAT\n\n**Parallel Search:**\n- Gold: OR-Tools CP-SAT\n- Silver: PicatSAT\n- Bronze: iZplus\n\n**Local Search:**\n- Gold: OR-Tools CP-SAT LS\n- Silver: Yuck\n- Bronze: Atlantis\n\n## Notable Observations\n\nOR-Tools CP-SAT dominated the competition, winning gold across three of four categories. Pumpkin appeared as a bronze medalist in the fixed search division (tied with SICStus Prolog). \n\nChuffed and Gecode, while entered by challenge organizers, were ineligible for prizes but participated in scoring. The page notes that \"there is no OPEN medal this year as there were no portfolio solver entrants at the competition deadline.\"\n\nSpecific benchmark scores and detailed performance metrics require accessing the interactive results tool on the webpage rather than the summary provided."}]},"uuid":"a24a21dc-fb11-4409-b878-363f064e5493","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:08:02.379Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"2c5b21c6-fa86-4277-ade8-c3921036ce09","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"b27564aa-f034-4151-9640-98e594a2bd97","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"a97ae4416eb4bd8cf","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AX1ox7ZASNk6du6xeUFKrd","type":"tool_result","content":"# Glasgow Constraint Solver Python Interface (gcspy)\n\n## Installation Method\nThe package can be installed via pip with `pip3 install gcspy` or by cloning the repository and running `pip3 install .`\n\n## Project Overview\nThis is a Python wrapper for the Glasgow Constraint Solver, a constraint programming solver developed for research into pseudo-Boolean proof-logging and auditable constraint solving. The interface is primarily designed for integration with the CPMpy modeling library.\n\n## Technical Architecture\nThe implementation wraps functionality in a single class (api.hh/api.cc) using standard library types exclusively. Python bindings are generated through pybind11, which is incorporated via CMake's FetchContent mechanism.\n\n## Code Composition\nThe repository contains Python (48.3%), C++ (48.2%), and CMake (3.5%) components.\n\n## Project Maturity\nThe repository shows minimal adoption metrics: 0 stars, 0 forks, and contains only 7 commits. No releases have been published yet.\n\n## Supported Constraints & API Examples\nThe web page does not provide specific information about supported constraint types or concrete API usage examples.\n\n## Dependencies\nThe primary external dependency is pybind11 for Python/C++ interoperability. Additional system requirements are not detailed in the available content."}]},"uuid":"e99ba7b7-ab8f-4d78-a915-d945884bcd8a","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:08:02.444Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b27564aa-f034-4151-9640-98e594a2bd97","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"10e00336-dad0-49e2-9adc-6685929b7ec6","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"a97ae4416eb4bd8cf","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FUBYv1fqPJq34hLE8jvZdj","type":"tool_result","content":"# CPMpy Pumpkin Interface Overview\n\n## What is Pumpkin?\n\nPumpkin is \"a combinatorial optimisation solver developed by the ConSol Lab at TU Delft\" based on lazy clause generation constraint programming. The CPMpy interface enables users to leverage this solver through the CPMpy modeling language.\n\n## Installation\n\nTo use Pumpkin with CPMpy, install the Python package via:\n```\npip install pumpkin-solver\n```\n\nAlways instantiate the solver using `cp.SolverLookup.get(\"pumpkin\")` rather than directly.\n\n## Supported Constraints\n\nThe Pumpkin backend supports these global constraints:\n- **Standard constraints**: alldifferent, element, table, negative_table\n- **Arithmetic operations**: abs, div, min, max\n- **Scheduling**: cumulative, no_overlap\n- **Domain constraints**: InDomain\n\nNotably, reified global constraints are not supported.\n\n## Key Methods\n\n**Core solving operations:**\n- `solve()` - Execute the solver with optional time limits, proof generation, and assumptions\n- `solveAll()` - Find multiple solutions with configurable limits\n- `minimize()` / `maximize()` - Define optimization objectives\n- `add()` - Post constraints to the underlying solver\n\n**Advanced features:**\n- `get_core()` - Returns UNSAT cores when solving with assumptions\n- `solution_hint()` - Warm-start the solver with partial assignments\n- `objective_value()` - Retrieve the best objective value found\n\n## Important Limitations\n\nThe interface automatically transforms unsupported expressions through CPMpy's transformation pipeline. Some constraints may require conversion before posting to Pumpkin."}]},"uuid":"31096441-47d7-4752-952e-9d004e88a209","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:08:05.968Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"10e00336-dad0-49e2-9adc-6685929b7ec6","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"31096441-47d7-4752-952e-9d004e88a209","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a97ae4416eb4bd8cf","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01M9fac1dgRdcHu3HgcvmCn4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013eVB2BFiKJhewxKkoysjM7","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://github.com/ConSol-Lab/Pumpkin/releases","prompt":"List all releases with dates. Especially anything after 0.3.0. Latest commit activity."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2023,"cache_read_input_tokens":30580,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2023,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":60,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CaotgPXJcX9dRAdr4v4Es","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"9c543e41-8564-49a2-b926-596782a50939","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:08:09.572Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
